    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d354">

                <pb facs="0326" n="316" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg316"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/4–2149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-21T15:00:00+08:00">April 21, 1949—3
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received April 21—3:34 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1281. From Merchant. Sufficient doubt my mind re T. V. Soong’s motivations and
                    intentions leaves me satisfied over postponement frank talk with him. However,
                    request authority in my discretion to interview him along lines Deptel 59 to
                    Taipei April 15 if circumstances in my judgment so indicate (reference Deptel
                    697 to Shanghai April 20). Will return Taipei by MA<anchor n="32"
                        xml:id="d354-f1"/> plane from Nanking early April 26.</p>
                <p>New subject: Tarring of J. G. White has returned from Japan and reports power
                    industrial related equipment available for Taiwan reconstruction requirements at
                    prices and delivery dates approximately <pb facs="0327" n="317" xml:id="pg317"/>
                    one-third less than in US. This should bring J. G. White-screened reconstruction
                    projects within tentative ECA earmarked 17,000,000. [Merchant.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
